41505::$$$message_0305_0000_0000$$$::"Kaede Makidera. The character artist has a blunt comment about her: [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01a(中)]'In a way, she's a heroine.'"::
41506::$$$message_0305_0001_0000$$$::"Yep.[br]You could say that the animator was so hooked on her, it wouldn't be an exaggeration to say that [font italic=true]Hollow Ataraxia[font italic=false] was made entirely of Kaede Makidera."::
41507::$$$message_0305_0002_0000$$$::"We even had to temporarily ban them from working on any more Makidera.[br]The Chronicles of the Great Dancing Makidera."::
41508::$$$message_0305_0003_0000$$$::"Still, isn't this a little too awful for a 100-yen ema?"��w